{
 "align_labels_right": 0,
 "creation": "2026-05-17 00:00:00.000000",
 "custom_format": 1,
 "disabled": 0,
 "doc_type": "Salary Slip",
 "docstatus": 0,
 "doctype": "Print Format",
 "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"/>\n<style>\n* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\nbody { font-family: \"Apple SD Gothic Neo\", \"Malgun Gothic\", \"Noto Sans KR\", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: #111; }\n.page { width: 210mm; min-height: 297mm; padding: 20mm 20mm 25mm 20mm; }\nh1 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0.15em; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n.subtitle { text-align: center; font-size: 10px; color: #777; margin-bottom: 28px; }\ntable { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 16px; }\nth, td { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 7px 10px; font-size: 11.5px; vertical-align: top; }\nth { background: #f5f5f5; font-weight: 600; text-align: left; width: 26%; white-space: nowrap; }\n.section-title { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; margin: 18px 0 6px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; padding-bottom: 3px; }\n.amount { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.total-row th, .total-row td { background: #eef2ff; font-weight: 700; }\n.net-row th, .net-row td { background: #1a3c6e; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; }\n.badge { display: inline-block; font-size: 10px; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 3px; background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; margin-left: 6px; }\n.badge-warn { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }\n.footer-note { font-size: 9.5px; color: #666; margin-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 8px; line-height: 1.6; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n<h1>임금명세서</h1>\n<p class=\"subtitle\">Wage Statement &mdash; 근로기준법 시행령 제27조의2</p>\n\n<p class=\"section-title\">근로자 정보</p>\n<table>\n<tr><th>회사명</th><td>{{ doc.company or \"&mdash;\" }}</td><th>사번</th><td>{{ doc.employee or \"&mdash;\" }}</td></tr>\n<tr><th>성명</th><td>{{ doc.employee_name or \"&mdash;\" }}</td><th>생년월일</th><td>{{ doc.date_of_birth or \"&mdash;\" }}</td></tr>\n<tr><th>부서</th><td>{{ doc.department or \"&mdash;\" }}</td><th>직급</th><td>{{ doc.designation or \"&mdash;\" }}</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<p class=\"section-title\">지급 정보</p>\n<table>\n<tr><th>임금 지급일</th><td>{{ doc.posting_date or \"&mdash;\" }}</td><th>임금 산정 기간</th><td>{{ doc.start_date or \"&mdash;\" }} ~ {{ doc.end_date or \"&mdash;\" }}</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<p class=\"section-title\">지급 내역 (법정 §4·§5 항목별 금액·계산방법)</p>\n<table>\n<tr><th>항목</th><th>계산 방법</th><th class=\"amount\">금액 (원)</th></tr>\n{% for row in doc.earnings %}\n<tr>\n<td>{{ row.salary_component or \"&mdash;\" }}{% if row.do_not_include_in_total %} <span class=\"badge badge-warn\">비과세</span>{% endif %}</td>\n<td style=\"font-size:10.5px;color:#555;\">{{ row.abbr or \"&mdash;\" }}</td>\n<td class=\"amount\">{{ \"{:,}\".format((row.amount or 0) | int) }}</td>\n</tr>\n{% endfor %}\n<tr class=\"total-row\"><th colspan=\"2\">지급 합계</th><td class=\"amount\">{{ \"{:,}\".format((doc.gross_pay or 0) | int) }}</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<p class=\"section-title\">공제 내역 (법정 §6 항목별 금액·산출내역)</p>\n<table>\n<tr><th>항목</th><th>산출 내역</th><th class=\"amount\">금액 (원)</th></tr>\n{% for row in doc.deductions %}\n<tr>\n<td>{{ row.salary_component or \"&mdash;\" }}</td>\n<td style=\"font-size:10.5px;color:#555;\">{{ row.abbr or \"&mdash;\" }}</td>\n<td class=\"amount\">{{ \"{:,}\".format((row.amount or 0) | int) }}</td>\n</tr>\n{% endfor %}\n<tr class=\"total-row\"><th colspan=\"2\">공제 합계</th><td class=\"amount\">{{ \"{:,}\".format((doc.total_deduction or 0) | int) }}</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n{% if doc.earnings | selectattr(\"do_not_include_in_total\") | list %}\n<p class=\"section-title\">비과세 항목 (법정 §7)</p>\n<table>\n<tr><th>항목</th><th>비고</th><th class=\"amount\">금액 (원)</th></tr>\n{% for row in doc.earnings %}\n{% if row.do_not_include_in_total %}\n<tr>\n<td>{{ row.salary_component or \"&mdash;\" }} <span class=\"badge\">비과세</span></td>\n<td style=\"font-size:10.5px;color:#555;\">{{ row.abbr or \"소득세법 시행령 해당 조항\" }}</td>\n<td class=\"amount\">{{ \"{:,}\".format((row.amount or 0) | int) }}</td>\n</tr>\n{% endif %}\n{% endfor %}\n</table>\n{% endif %}\n\n<table>\n<tr class=\"net-row\"><th colspan=\"2\">실 지급액</th><td class=\"amount\">{{ \"{:,}\".format((doc.net_pay or 0) | int) }} 원</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<div class=\"footer-note\">\n&nbsp;※ 이 명세서는 근로기준법 시행령 제27조의2에 따라 발급된 공식 임금명세서입니다.<br>\n&nbsp;※ 비과세 항목은 소득세법 시행령 제17조의2 등 관련 규정에 따라 구분됩니다.<br>\n&nbsp;※ 문의: {{ doc.company or \"\" }} 인사/급여 담당 &middot; 문서번호: {{ doc.name or \"\" }} &middot; 발급일: {{ doc.posting_date or \"\" }}\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
 "idx": 0,
